  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">St&#xf6;d till andra fasen i en process om tre faser f&#xf6;r att etablera en Equal Opportunity Commission i Uganda. Kommissionens etableras med st&#xf6;d av Ugandas konstitution 1995 d&#xe4;r inr&#xe4;ttandet av en s&#xe5;dan kommission omn&#xe4;mns. Samarbets- och avtalspartner &#xe4;r Ministry of Gender, Labour and Social Development.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to the second phase in a tree phase process to establish an Equal Opportunity Commission in Uganda. The establishment of the Commiossion is backed by the Constitution of Uganda 1995. The cooperation partner is the Ministry of Gender, Labour and Social Development, which also signs the agreement.</narrative>
  </description>
